WEBVTT

00:01:06.905 --> 00:01:08.282
Hey, Ysa!

00:01:08.324 --> 00:01:10.075
Let's just let her rest.

00:01:10.451 --> 00:01:12.536
She most likely just entered her inner world.

00:01:13.454 --> 00:01:14.580
Inner world, doc?

00:01:14.705 --> 00:01:16.248
Whenever a personality takes over,

00:01:16.248 --> 00:01:18.626
That's usually where Ysa goes,

00:01:18.626 --> 00:01:20.377
And the other personalities are also there.

00:01:20.628 --> 00:01:21.629
You know, Estong...

00:01:21.962 --> 00:01:23.922
Ysa has a unique condition.

00:01:24.298 --> 00:01:26.842
Of course, we want to make sure if...

00:01:27.176 --> 00:01:30.846
You'll have a positive effect on her or make things worse.

00:01:30.971 --> 00:01:33.265
You bring out the best of us.

00:01:33.641 --> 00:01:34.933
Maybe...

00:01:35.684 --> 00:01:38.270
Maybe this exhibit just isn't meant for me.

00:01:40.856 --> 00:01:41.899
You're all too loud!

00:01:41.899 --> 00:01:43.984
You're all too loud! Stop it!

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.195
I can't finish that all by myself.

00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:51.950
What if it gets to the point where...

00:01:52.284 --> 00:01:54.995
I'll start to like you more than as a friend?

00:01:55.329 --> 00:01:57.581
We can't be more than friends.

00:01:57.915 --> 00:01:59.625
You can't pursue me.

00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:01.669
We can never be together.

00:02:02.461 --> 00:02:04.004
You can't fall in love with me.

00:03:26.378 --> 00:03:27.212
Estong...

00:03:27.963 --> 00:03:28.964
Seems like

00:03:28.964 --> 00:03:31.049
You don't like my cooking anymore.

00:03:32.009 --> 00:03:32.801
No, Pops.

00:03:32.801 --> 00:03:34.470
That's just what heartbreak does...

00:03:34.803 --> 00:03:36.430
Food just doesn't taste the same.

00:03:38.348 --> 00:03:39.057
Kuya...

00:03:40.768 --> 00:03:41.685
I'll take this, okay?

00:03:42.686 --> 00:03:43.812
You don't have an appetite anyway.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.356
I could've accepted it, Pops,

00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:47.983
If she had just said no.

00:03:49.401 --> 00:03:51.278
But I wish she had told me why...

00:03:52.029 --> 00:03:53.572
It wasn't possible.

00:03:54.031 --> 00:03:54.698
Kuya...

00:03:55.032 --> 00:03:56.200
Does it matter?

00:03:57.034 --> 00:03:57.951
If she doesn't want to,

00:03:58.243 --> 00:03:58.994
She doesn't want to.

00:03:59.286 --> 00:04:00.370
You got friend-zoned.

00:04:01.288 --> 00:04:02.289
I want this.

00:04:02.539 --> 00:04:03.290
It's mine.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.166
Uh...

00:04:05.334 --> 00:04:06.752
Hey, hey, Kuya, Kuya...

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.337
I was just kidding, okay?

00:04:09.087 --> 00:04:10.005
You know, Kuya...

00:04:10.422 --> 00:04:12.424
That's just Ate Ysa

00:04:12.424 --> 00:04:13.592
Playing hard to get,

00:04:14.051 --> 00:04:14.885
Like Adel.

00:04:15.886 --> 00:04:17.429
Hey, wait a minute.

00:04:18.055 --> 00:04:20.516
Why? Do you have a thing for Adel now?

00:04:21.183 --> 00:04:24.228
Didn't you say she doesn't even reply to your messages?

00:04:24.228 --> 00:04:26.522
And she's always so annoyed with you.

00:04:27.105 --> 00:04:28.482
So you got seen-zoned after all.

00:04:28.482 --> 00:04:30.108
And you got "annoyed-zoned", too.

00:04:31.318 --> 00:04:34.029
Hold on, Pops. Why are we talking about me now?

00:04:34.321 --> 00:04:35.739
Isn't Kuya the one who got rejected?

00:04:35.739 --> 00:04:37.115
- Not me. - Hey, hey!

00:04:37.115 --> 00:04:38.200
Whoa, easy.

00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:40.118
I wasn't rejected, okay?

00:04:40.619 --> 00:04:42.246
I only asked her if it was possible.

00:04:43.205 --> 00:04:44.456
That's basically the same thing, Kuya.

00:04:44.832 --> 00:04:46.083
That's enough, both of you.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.627
Seriously, Estong...

00:04:48.627 --> 00:04:49.711
So...

00:04:49.711 --> 00:04:52.589
What's your plan now that you've been rejected?

00:04:52.589 --> 00:04:54.127
Pops, I told you, I wasn't rejected, okay?

00:04:54.152 --> 00:04:55.526
No, I was just asking.

00:04:55.551 --> 00:04:56.416
Sorry.

00:04:58.637 --> 00:04:59.763
You already know me, Pops.

00:05:00.597 --> 00:05:01.974
I don't give up that easily.

00:05:16.493 --> 00:05:17.524
Ysa, my dear.

00:05:18.836 --> 00:05:20.671
Try not to think too much about what happened yesterday.

00:05:21.599 --> 00:05:23.571
Don't overthink it,

00:05:23.958 --> 00:05:26.419
Because it might be unhealthy for you, for all of you.

00:05:28.417 --> 00:05:30.002
That's exactly what I was talking about—

00:05:30.002 --> 00:05:31.503
That Estong would fall for her.

00:05:32.045 --> 00:05:32.880
It's not just that.

00:05:33.255 --> 00:05:37.009
I'm worried he hasn't really moved on yet.

00:05:37.009 --> 00:05:39.011
What if you end up just being his—

00:05:39.011 --> 00:05:39.928
Rebound?

00:05:41.513 --> 00:05:42.598
A fallback.

00:05:43.307 --> 00:05:44.391
Placeholder.

00:05:44.683 --> 00:05:45.434
His safety net.

00:05:45.434 --> 00:05:47.811
Something like that. Call it whatever you want.

00:05:50.689 --> 00:05:52.649
I just feel guilty.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:55.944
I didn't get to explain to Estong the real reason

00:05:55.944 --> 00:05:58.071
Why I reacted that way.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:05:59.865
I just walked away.

00:06:01.033 --> 00:06:03.493
Why didn't you just tell him right away, to get it over with?

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.331
I just don't want him to think or feel that...

00:06:08.165 --> 00:06:10.626
I only used him, or that I lied to him.

00:06:11.844 --> 00:06:14.638
It's not your fault, Ysa.

00:06:14.838 --> 00:06:16.757
I already made it clear to Estong.

00:06:16.965 --> 00:06:21.094
I told him that if he started seeing you as more than a friend,

00:06:21.094 --> 00:06:22.721
He had to let it go.

00:06:23.221 --> 00:06:24.063
Love,

00:06:24.473 --> 00:06:27.392
We all knew he wouldn't be able to help it, okay?

00:06:27.559 --> 00:06:28.560
Truth is...

00:06:29.102 --> 00:06:31.104
I should've put a stop to it right from the beginning

00:06:31.104 --> 00:06:32.940
And told him the truth.

00:06:34.232 --> 00:06:35.142
Nang, don't.

00:06:36.568 --> 00:06:37.399
Please don't.

00:06:37.945 --> 00:06:39.363
Let's just let it be.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:42.074
I don't want things to get even more complicated.

00:06:42.074 --> 00:06:44.076
I'll just avoid him, and then...

00:06:45.035 --> 00:06:46.578
It will stop there.

00:06:47.579 --> 00:06:48.465
That's right, Pops.

00:06:48.956 --> 00:06:50.290
Kuya has done this before.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.377
He kept hoping his ex, Ate Jean, would come back,

00:06:53.627 --> 00:06:56.338
Even after everyone kept telling him it was over.

00:06:56.713 --> 00:06:57.881
How much more now,

00:06:57.881 --> 00:07:00.133
When he's only been rejected once by Ate Ysa?

00:07:02.857 --> 00:07:06.193
You really took our saying to heart.

00:07:07.391 --> 00:07:08.642
While there's still breath in us...

00:07:09.685 --> 00:07:11.269
There's still a fight in us!

00:07:12.729 --> 00:07:14.272
So it was your fault after all.

00:07:16.809 --> 00:07:17.851
But

00:07:17.989 --> 00:07:19.574
Remember this, son...

00:07:20.195 --> 00:07:22.864
We all know that Ysa has a...

00:07:23.949 --> 00:07:25.617
Special condition.

00:07:26.368 --> 00:07:30.872
So how you treat her and care for her,

00:07:31.248 --> 00:07:32.499
Should also be special.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:36.003
Especially when it comes to her emotions.

00:07:39.047 --> 00:07:40.132
I already know that, Pops.

00:07:41.925 --> 00:07:43.218
Go on, eat.

00:07:44.511 --> 00:07:46.555
Take back what you took from his plate.

00:07:46.722 --> 00:07:48.765
Kuya, he told me to take back what I took from your plate.

00:07:50.392 --> 00:07:51.560
And then, put it in mine.

00:07:54.396 --> 00:07:55.307
What?

00:07:56.064 --> 00:07:57.502
I was the one who cooked the food, didn't I?

00:08:01.111 --> 00:08:03.030
Ysa, next time...

00:08:03.572 --> 00:08:05.157
If he keeps bothering you,

00:08:05.449 --> 00:08:06.908
You don't need to explain yourself.

00:08:07.325 --> 00:08:08.201
Just turn him down.

00:08:08.535 --> 00:08:09.619
He'll understand.

00:08:16.918 --> 00:08:17.767
Ysa,

00:08:18.003 --> 00:08:19.421
Do you like Estong?

00:08:22.132 --> 00:08:23.025
What?

00:08:24.426 --> 00:08:26.428
If you do, let me say this again...

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.305
Let it go.

00:08:29.139 --> 00:08:32.768
We're only trying to protect you from what happened before.

00:08:37.773 --> 00:08:39.441
Alright, that's enough. Let's just eat.

00:08:41.443 --> 00:08:43.028
Come on, eat, okay?

00:08:44.112 --> 00:08:45.322
Did you put calamansi in this?

00:08:48.992 --> 00:08:50.535
- Thank you! - Thank you!

00:08:56.249 --> 00:08:57.375
Are you sure, Ate?

00:08:57.542 --> 00:08:59.336
You're going to avoid Kuya Estong from now on?

00:09:01.004 --> 00:09:02.339
So you're not friends anymore?

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:04.966
I have to.

00:09:07.677 --> 00:09:09.262
He's difficult to talk to.

00:09:09.763 --> 00:09:11.348
Hey, man, come on!

00:09:11.848 --> 00:09:13.975
Ate, Ate! It's Kuya Estong. Hide now!

00:09:14.226 --> 00:09:15.811
- Excuse me. - You're so annoying.

00:09:16.103 --> 00:09:17.411
- Where will I go? - Just hide!

00:09:19.269 --> 00:09:20.353
Hide now!

00:09:20.482 --> 00:09:21.691
What an idiot.

00:09:23.819 --> 00:09:25.474
Hey, wait! Stay right there!

00:09:26.003 --> 00:09:27.045
I have a cough.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:29.591
I'm really sick, and it's contagious. Stay back!

00:09:29.616 --> 00:09:30.606
You'll catch it!

00:09:31.409 --> 00:09:32.494
- Go on. - Wait, is Ysa there?

00:09:32.719 --> 00:09:33.804
- I just want to talk to her. - No.

00:09:33.829 --> 00:09:35.055
No, no you can't.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.164
I got her sick.

00:09:36.164 --> 00:09:37.415
We might start a pandemic.

00:09:37.415 --> 00:09:38.583
Do you want to get sick too?

00:09:38.583 --> 00:09:39.501
Just leave!

00:09:40.293 --> 00:09:41.378
Can I at least see her?

00:09:41.378 --> 00:09:44.339
- I just want to check on her. - You can't. It's really contagious!

00:09:44.339 --> 00:09:45.841
It's really, really bad!

00:09:45.841 --> 00:09:46.424
As in!

00:09:46.424 --> 00:09:48.817
We're really sick so just go, Kuya!

00:09:48.844 --> 00:09:50.887
You're not allowed to see her for days or even week.

00:09:50.887 --> 00:09:51.805
You really can't!

00:09:51.805 --> 00:09:53.115
- Oh, really? - Come on, just go!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.391
Come on, just leave now, Kuya!

00:09:54.599 --> 00:09:56.977
You really, really can't!

00:09:59.187 --> 00:09:59.855
Damn!

00:10:05.735 --> 00:10:06.661
What was that?

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.185
- Hey. - Sounds like someone was barking.

00:10:09.489 --> 00:10:10.991
What are you doing there, dear?

00:10:11.283 --> 00:10:12.050
What?

00:10:12.075 --> 00:10:14.077
She's hiding from Estong, Ninang.

00:10:14.953 --> 00:10:16.329
Looks like he already left.

00:10:17.622 --> 00:10:19.916
But I really feel bad for Kuya Estong.

00:10:21.126 --> 00:10:23.128
Seems like he really wants to talk to you.

00:10:23.837 --> 00:10:25.505
I'm also doing this for all of us.

00:10:25.922 --> 00:10:27.674
I think he'll understand.

00:10:40.061 --> 00:10:40.979
Oh, my.

00:10:42.772 --> 00:10:43.674
Here we are.

00:10:44.774 --> 00:10:46.401
- Hey, ma'am! - My order's here.

00:10:46.401 --> 00:10:47.652
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:10:51.338 --> 00:10:52.547
Give me ma’am’s order.

00:10:54.993 --> 00:10:55.901
Here, Kuya.

00:10:59.247 --> 00:11:00.081
Here you go, ma'am.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:01.674
Thank you.

00:11:03.793 --> 00:11:04.753
Here.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:05.629
Thank you.

00:11:05.629 --> 00:11:06.630
You get tips, okay?

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.547
Especially you.

00:11:10.008 --> 00:11:11.092
Uh...thank you so much!

00:11:11.301 --> 00:11:12.928
Feel free to order from us again, ma'am.

00:11:13.094 --> 00:11:14.070
Oh, sure.

00:11:14.095 --> 00:11:15.764
Only if you're on the menu.

00:11:20.602 --> 00:11:21.432
Uh...

00:11:22.145 --> 00:11:23.772
Sure, ma'am. When you order from us,

00:11:23.772 --> 00:11:25.982
We'll deliver it to you ourselves.

00:11:25.982 --> 00:11:27.609
- It's not a problem. - Just kidding!

00:11:28.151 --> 00:11:29.819
But I'm not joking about you being handsome, okay?

00:11:29.819 --> 00:11:30.904
I'm sure...

00:11:31.863 --> 00:11:33.565
You've had women hit on you.

00:11:34.824 --> 00:11:35.617
Thank you!

00:11:35.617 --> 00:11:36.326
Oh, no, ma'am.

00:11:36.534 --> 00:11:37.594
Not at all.

00:11:37.619 --> 00:11:38.245
Actually...

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.523
Women either leave him or avoid him.

00:11:40.548 --> 00:11:41.487
Oh, really?

00:11:42.791 --> 00:11:44.251
Well, okay. Thank you!

00:11:46.211 --> 00:11:47.212
Let's go, Kuya.

00:11:50.215 --> 00:11:51.260
You know, bro...

00:11:51.458 --> 00:11:52.729
I wonder where Ysa is.

00:11:53.009 --> 00:11:54.678
I really want to talk to her.

00:11:55.762 --> 00:11:56.869
Actually, Kuya...

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:59.641
I already tried fishing for info from Adel, but there's nothing.

00:12:00.016 --> 00:12:00.877
But...

00:12:01.303 --> 00:12:02.554
Let's try to find some clues.

00:12:03.728 --> 00:12:04.549
Wait, hold on.

00:12:08.108 --> 00:12:09.104
Kuya, Kuya.

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.193
I think...I think they're just somewhere nearby.

00:12:13.905 --> 00:12:16.908
I can't. It's so hot.

00:12:16.908 --> 00:12:19.536
I can't take it anymore!

00:12:19.786 --> 00:12:20.996
- Bro, just a moment, okay? - Okay.

00:12:21.329 --> 00:12:22.455
Hey, he's here.

00:12:22.622 --> 00:12:24.082
Uh...let's go home, Ate?

00:12:24.082 --> 00:12:24.666
Uh...

00:12:25.125 --> 00:12:26.376
Cacai! Adel!

00:12:26.584 --> 00:12:29.170
- Let's go home. - No, it's even hotter at home!

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.255
- Where are you headed? - I don't wanna go there.

00:12:30.255 --> 00:12:31.339
Not now.

00:12:32.549 --> 00:12:33.466
Hide me.

00:12:33.466 --> 00:12:34.698
Are you okay, Cacai?

00:12:35.802 --> 00:12:36.666
Me?

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:38.596
Oh, clearly not.

00:12:38.847 --> 00:12:40.724
'Cause, you know, it's hot. I can't.

00:12:41.641 --> 00:12:43.601
Want to go to our café? It's cooler there.

00:12:43.601 --> 00:12:44.769
- It's open air. - No!

00:12:44.978 --> 00:12:45.687
No!

00:12:45.687 --> 00:12:47.147
I don't like it there.

00:12:47.689 --> 00:12:48.398
- But why? - No!

00:12:48.398 --> 00:12:49.065
Why not?

00:12:49.274 --> 00:12:50.692
No! No! No!

00:12:50.942 --> 00:12:51.860
You know why?

00:12:52.193 --> 00:12:53.018
Oh.

00:12:53.987 --> 00:12:55.572
You might get offended, though.

00:12:55.864 --> 00:12:56.548
But

00:12:56.573 --> 00:12:58.366
It's up to you if you want to be offended.

00:12:58.992 --> 00:13:00.660
From what I've heard...

00:13:00.869 --> 00:13:02.746
If it weren't for café,

00:13:02.746 --> 00:13:05.582
The two of you wouldn't have met.

00:13:08.168 --> 00:13:09.919
Does Ysa regret meeting me?

00:13:12.464 --> 00:13:15.258
I think I'm not the right person to ask.

00:13:15.967 --> 00:13:17.594
But I'll give you a little clue,

00:13:17.594 --> 00:13:18.636
Just so you know.

00:13:19.137 --> 00:13:20.847
She wants you to focus on yourself,

00:13:21.264 --> 00:13:24.476
Because she feels that you haven't really gotten over your ex.

00:13:26.603 --> 00:13:27.854
What made her say that?

00:13:28.563 --> 00:13:29.481
Oh.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.149
That I don't know.

00:13:31.149 --> 00:13:32.192
That's all I know.

00:13:32.692 --> 00:13:33.943
And that's all I'd say.

00:13:34.255 --> 00:13:35.172
Well, then.

00:13:35.695 --> 00:13:37.364
- Ate, let's go? - Don't tell her about what I said, okay?

00:13:37.364 --> 00:13:38.490
Don't tell her it came from me.

00:13:38.698 --> 00:13:39.783
- Let's go? - Come on, let's go.

00:13:40.087 --> 00:13:41.161
Let's go!

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:03.056
Where is it?

00:14:03.473 --> 00:14:06.142
Here's the address, bro. 1272-B Gumamela Street, Brgy. Kinamulatan.

00:14:06.142 --> 00:14:08.812
Bro, where are you? Are you gonna be much longer? We're hungry.

00:14:09.187 --> 00:14:12.065
There, we just need to keep our wrists relaxed.

00:14:12.232 --> 00:14:15.193
Then, we just need to trust our creativity.

00:14:15.193 --> 00:14:16.945
- Ysa? - and imagination.

00:14:17.362 --> 00:14:19.322
You can almost do anything.

00:14:19.906 --> 00:14:21.449
And then, you can just let it flow.

00:14:21.449 --> 00:14:23.493
Keep your wrists relaxed.

00:14:24.411 --> 00:14:25.995
So that everything can flow,

00:14:25.995 --> 00:14:28.373
Which makes painting more fun.

00:14:28.581 --> 00:14:29.609
- Ysa! - And then...

00:14:30.792 --> 00:14:31.876
And you can just...

00:14:32.127 --> 00:14:34.629
Just keep on trusting your creativity.

00:14:34.629 --> 00:14:35.547
- You can also... - Ysa.

00:14:35.547 --> 00:14:38.675
Recreate whatever you see in our nature.

00:14:39.592 --> 00:14:40.677
Like that!

00:14:40.677 --> 00:14:41.594
Ysa.

00:14:41.803 --> 00:14:42.679
Oh, wow!

00:14:42.679 --> 00:14:44.681
Your work looks beautiful.

00:14:44.681 --> 00:14:45.598
Ysa, Ysa.

00:14:47.684 --> 00:14:48.593
Estong!

00:14:48.923 --> 00:14:50.031
Didn't see you there.

00:14:51.564 --> 00:14:52.445
Yes.

00:14:54.149 --> 00:14:55.233
What are you doing here?

00:14:56.276 --> 00:14:57.710
I am just making a delivery.

00:14:57.735 --> 00:14:58.586
How 'bout you?

00:14:58.611 --> 00:14:59.529
- I see. - What's up?

00:14:59.529 --> 00:15:02.323
Well, I'm busy teaching painting.

00:15:03.408 --> 00:15:04.273
Oh.

00:15:04.382 --> 00:15:07.385
Wow! That one on the swing is so cute!

00:15:07.912 --> 00:15:09.164
Ysa, are you free later?

00:15:09.619 --> 00:15:11.007
I was hoping we could talk.

00:15:12.292 --> 00:15:13.460
Could you check my work, please?

00:15:14.836 --> 00:15:15.753
Hey, I got here first.

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.088
No, I did.

00:15:17.255 --> 00:15:19.549
You're such a show-off, huh? Mine's better.

00:15:19.549 --> 00:15:20.633
No, mine is.

00:15:20.633 --> 00:15:21.801
I got here first, okay?

00:15:21.801 --> 00:15:23.136
Do you always have to be the bad guy?

00:15:23.136 --> 00:15:24.804
Your work looks terrible.

00:15:26.264 --> 00:15:27.348
Why are you always like that?

00:15:27.348 --> 00:15:29.350
- Your work doesn't even look good. - Hey!

00:15:29.726 --> 00:15:31.853
What are you two arguing about? You're so noisy!

00:15:31.853 --> 00:15:34.189
You better not disappoint me with your work!

00:15:34.522 --> 00:15:36.024
Oh, wait. It's not yet finished.

00:15:36.524 --> 00:15:38.151
I'll work more on mine.

00:15:39.839 --> 00:15:42.049
Always so much to say.

00:15:43.323 --> 00:15:44.366
And you!

00:15:44.391 --> 00:15:45.589
Why are you still here?!

00:15:46.159 --> 00:15:48.036
You! Back off!

00:15:48.036 --> 00:15:49.579
Stay away from Ysa!

00:15:50.914 --> 00:15:51.764
Bogart...

00:15:51.789 --> 00:15:53.666
I thought we were buddies?

00:15:53.856 --> 00:15:55.316
Maybe you can help me out.

00:15:55.585 --> 00:15:56.413
Please.

00:15:57.182 --> 00:15:58.600
What's going on?

00:15:59.015 --> 00:16:01.702
How should I know?! I just read something in Ysa's diary...

00:16:02.008 --> 00:16:02.884
It said that

00:16:02.884 --> 00:16:05.272
You're still unsure about what you want in life!

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.274
Because of my ex.

00:16:19.192 --> 00:16:20.985
Because I have no direction in life.

00:16:22.278 --> 00:16:23.905
That's why Ysa

00:16:23.905 --> 00:16:25.616
Doesn't want me to pursue her.

00:16:29.827 --> 00:16:31.079
Bogart, maybe you can—

00:16:31.227 --> 00:16:33.280
Maybe you can talk to her. Please, Bogart.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.460
Yeye don't know anything.

00:16:38.461 --> 00:16:39.452
Yeye!

00:16:39.671 --> 00:16:40.764
It's your best friend!

00:16:40.838 --> 00:16:41.733
Best friend!

00:16:41.923 --> 00:16:43.007
Why?

00:16:43.007 --> 00:16:44.061
What's going on?

00:16:44.425 --> 00:16:45.389
I can't.

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:47.804
They all told me

00:16:47.804 --> 00:16:48.888
Not to talk.

00:16:49.514 --> 00:16:50.265
Come on,

00:16:50.265 --> 00:16:51.474
We're best friends, right?

00:16:51.474 --> 00:16:53.685
We made a pinky promise, remember?

00:16:53.685 --> 00:16:55.812
Do you want something? A lollipop?

00:16:55.812 --> 00:16:57.272
You love lollipops, right?

00:16:57.855 --> 00:16:59.649
Or...balloons?!

00:16:59.649 --> 00:17:01.442
Some balloons! You wanna play?

00:17:01.985 --> 00:17:03.319
So, what did she say? What’s the problem?

00:17:03.319 --> 00:17:04.462
Can you tell it

00:17:04.487 --> 00:17:05.590
To your best friend?

00:17:08.408 --> 00:17:11.160
No! Can't talk.

00:17:11.327 --> 00:17:13.121
Yeye is a good girl.

00:17:13.621 --> 00:17:14.872
No!

00:17:22.213 --> 00:17:22.465
Hello?

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.482
- Kuya, where are you?! Where's my order?! - Ah...yes, ma'am! I'm still on the way.

00:17:24.507 --> 00:17:26.067
I'm still on the way. I'm really sorry.

00:17:26.092 --> 00:17:27.114
Alright, okay.

00:17:48.086 --> 00:17:49.463
I haven't written anything yet.

00:17:49.532 --> 00:17:51.743
To solve this problem...

00:17:51.768 --> 00:17:53.645
We have to find "X."

00:17:55.538 --> 00:17:56.575
"X" again?

00:17:56.998 --> 00:17:58.625
It's always "ex", huh?

00:17:58.726 --> 00:17:59.676
Oh, man...

00:17:59.701 --> 00:18:02.090
You know, they really need to move on.

00:18:03.421 --> 00:18:05.465
Focus. Enough with the jokes.

00:18:05.871 --> 00:18:07.623
I'm focused, okay?

00:18:10.595 --> 00:18:12.764
If you end up failing the admission test...

00:18:12.764 --> 00:18:14.015
Don't blame me, okay?

00:18:15.099 --> 00:18:16.351
Maybe you're the one who's gonna fall.

00:18:16.351 --> 00:18:18.227
Oh, I mean...

00:18:18.811 --> 00:18:19.864
Fail.

00:18:22.023 --> 00:18:22.965
Gosh, you're annoying.

00:18:23.941 --> 00:18:24.997
Do you still have questions?

00:18:27.403 --> 00:18:29.197
Actually, I do.

00:18:30.865 --> 00:18:32.283
Are you still single—

00:18:32.283 --> 00:18:33.223
Yes.

00:18:33.618 --> 00:18:35.036
Yes, I'm still single.

00:18:35.787 --> 00:18:37.246
I mean Ate Ysa.

00:18:39.248 --> 00:18:40.223
Oh...

00:18:42.543 --> 00:18:43.403
Why?

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:45.278
Nothing.

00:18:45.546 --> 00:18:47.317
I just want to help Kuya out.

00:18:47.757 --> 00:18:50.760
I also want to know why they can't be more than friends.

00:18:51.177 --> 00:18:53.805
How can I answer that? I'm not Ate Ysa.

00:18:54.138 --> 00:18:54.976
But...

00:18:55.098 --> 00:18:56.974
I'm sure you know something.

00:18:57.225 --> 00:18:58.796
Both of you are close after all.

00:18:59.394 --> 00:19:00.645
Oh, I get it.

00:19:00.645 --> 00:19:03.106
So you came here to fish for information?

00:19:03.106 --> 00:19:04.857
You didn't come here to review.

00:19:04.857 --> 00:19:05.942
- Just go home. - Hey.

00:19:06.609 --> 00:19:07.695
I came here for both.

00:19:08.486 --> 00:19:09.337
Adel,

00:19:09.362 --> 00:19:10.613
Please, just tell me.

00:19:10.767 --> 00:19:13.049
I just want to know the answer.

00:19:13.074 --> 00:19:14.909
You're close to Ate Ysa.

00:19:15.702 --> 00:19:16.786
Jayden,

00:19:16.786 --> 00:19:18.287
Even if I know something,

00:19:18.287 --> 00:19:20.289
It's not my place to tell you.

00:19:20.937 --> 00:19:22.073
The truth is,

00:19:22.333 --> 00:19:24.168
I feel bad for your Kuya Estong.

00:19:25.086 --> 00:19:27.355
But Ate Ysa has it worse.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:28.131
You won't get it.

00:19:28.131 --> 00:19:29.674
It's too complicated.

00:19:29.882 --> 00:19:30.901
Very.

00:19:32.802 --> 00:19:34.053
That complicated?

00:19:35.847 --> 00:19:36.893
Yeah.

00:19:37.056 --> 00:19:39.434
It's more complicated than what I'm teaching you.

00:19:39.884 --> 00:19:41.784
At least this one has a clearer answer.

00:19:42.103 --> 00:19:43.354
But for her situation...

00:19:46.065 --> 00:19:47.143
I don't have one for that.

00:19:49.986 --> 00:19:50.792
Alright.

00:19:51.487 --> 00:19:52.405
You don't have to answer me,

00:19:52.905 --> 00:19:54.490
If it's that complicated.

00:19:55.908 --> 00:19:56.784
But as for you and me...

00:19:58.661 --> 00:19:59.912
Everything's clear, okay?

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.626
That's why I'm helping you review, okay?

00:20:05.835 --> 00:20:08.004
- Oh, right. Yes, the review. - Please, let's focus now, okay?

00:20:08.004 --> 00:20:08.980
Wait,

00:20:09.005 --> 00:20:10.590
I haven't even written anything yet.

00:20:21.476 --> 00:20:22.727
Miss, how much is this?

00:20:24.896 --> 00:20:26.789
The price tag is there, can't you see?

00:20:26.814 --> 00:20:28.816
It's already right there, miss. The price tag's big.

00:20:29.762 --> 00:20:31.305
I even had that printed out.

00:20:48.211 --> 00:20:48.795
Kuya.

00:20:49.337 --> 00:20:50.755
Are you stalking your ex again?

00:20:52.089 --> 00:20:53.591
What, are you getting back with Jean?

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:55.468
Are you giving up on Ysa?

00:20:58.054 --> 00:20:59.639
I spoke to some of

00:20:59.639 --> 00:21:01.766
Ysa’s other personalities earlier, Pops.

00:21:02.362 --> 00:21:04.698
I asked them why Ysa's avoiding me.

00:21:05.816 --> 00:21:07.244
They brought up my ex.

00:21:08.105 --> 00:21:09.690
She think I might not be over my ex yet.

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.777
Look, Pops. I'm stalking Jean.

00:21:13.277 --> 00:21:14.904
I'm looking at her pictures.

00:21:15.613 --> 00:21:17.406
But I can't feel anything for her anymore, Pops.

00:21:17.782 --> 00:21:19.408
I'm not even hurt anymore.

00:21:20.243 --> 00:21:21.953
That's why I'm sure I've already moved on.

00:21:23.037 --> 00:21:24.121
Are you sure, Kuya?

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:26.749
Like, if Jean talked to you,

00:21:26.958 --> 00:21:28.292
You wouldn't need closure anymore?

00:21:30.586 --> 00:21:32.338
We already had our closure, bro.

00:21:32.839 --> 00:21:34.465
I just couldn't accept it at first.

00:21:35.383 --> 00:21:36.300
I'm also okay now.

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:39.095
I'm happy wherever she is right now.

00:21:40.137 --> 00:21:42.056
I didn't even think about her until

00:21:42.056 --> 00:21:43.558
They brought up my ex.

00:21:46.143 --> 00:21:48.437
So is there another reason?

00:21:50.231 --> 00:21:52.525
I just read it in Ysa's diary...

00:21:52.817 --> 00:21:55.820
It said that you're still unsure about what you want in life!

00:21:57.655 --> 00:21:59.407
They also told me about...

00:22:00.491 --> 00:22:01.701
My direction in life.

00:22:12.545 --> 00:22:13.921
Are you going to take the exam again, Kuya?

00:22:14.714 --> 00:22:15.768
I need to.

00:22:17.967 --> 00:22:20.011
I need to find some direction in my life,

00:22:20.344 --> 00:22:21.245
So...

00:22:21.637 --> 00:22:22.555
I'm going to try again.

00:22:24.849 --> 00:22:25.683
That's right.

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:27.518
However...

00:22:28.102 --> 00:22:29.520
You should make decisions

00:22:29.729 --> 00:22:30.980
For yourself,

00:22:31.272 --> 00:22:32.690
Not for other people.

00:22:34.817 --> 00:22:36.235
I already know that, Pops.

00:22:37.612 --> 00:22:38.946
I just have to deal with both right now.

00:22:40.197 --> 00:22:41.616
I can do both, right?

00:22:44.785 --> 00:22:47.163
It's more fulfilling to have a goal

00:22:47.413 --> 00:22:48.831
When it's not just for yourself,

00:22:49.373 --> 00:22:50.625
But for other people too.

00:22:51.459 --> 00:22:52.543
Especially if...

00:22:52.877 --> 00:22:54.045
You love the person.

00:22:56.047 --> 00:22:56.964
So,

00:22:56.989 --> 00:22:59.561
You're really not going to Australia anymore, Kuya?

00:23:00.593 --> 00:23:01.677
That's still the plan, bro.

00:23:02.762 --> 00:23:04.513
But for now, while I wait...

00:23:04.931 --> 00:23:07.141
I'll just work as a virtual assistant.

00:23:08.434 --> 00:23:09.852
That's right. That's good.

00:23:10.603 --> 00:23:13.064
At least, you have a lot of options.

00:23:13.439 --> 00:23:14.523
Actually, Kuya...

00:23:14.941 --> 00:23:16.525
I talked to Adel earlier

00:23:16.525 --> 00:23:19.278
About why Ate Ysa's been avoiding you.

00:23:20.154 --> 00:23:21.238
She said it's difficult.

00:23:21.781 --> 00:23:22.782
It's complicated.

00:23:23.699 --> 00:23:25.952
That's why she doesn't want to tell us herself.

00:23:27.291 --> 00:23:29.340
I remembered what Tita Barbs told me.

00:23:30.665 --> 00:23:33.417
She said I don't know Ysa well enough yet.

00:23:34.001 --> 00:23:34.752
But...

00:23:34.961 --> 00:23:37.546
Kuya, haven't you met all of her personalities already?

00:23:40.257 --> 00:23:41.508
I honestly don't know.

00:23:42.802 --> 00:23:45.221
Well, whatever it is.

00:23:45.805 --> 00:23:47.974
I just want you to know that...

00:23:49.642 --> 00:23:51.185
I'm so proud of you, son.

00:23:51.560 --> 00:23:53.813
For all of the decisions you're making.

00:23:54.772 --> 00:23:55.856
Thank you, Pops.

00:23:58.359 --> 00:23:59.276
Come on, group hug!

00:23:59.986 --> 00:24:01.404
- Group hug? - Come on.

00:24:02.488 --> 00:24:03.698
But I'm a grown man and—

00:24:03.698 --> 00:24:06.117
Come on, we haven't done this for a long time.

00:24:06.117 --> 00:24:07.201
It's really okay, Pops.

00:24:07.535 --> 00:24:09.286
There's no one around, okay?

00:24:12.456 --> 00:24:13.541
Have you taken a bath yet, Kuya?

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:16.335
Of course I did, stupid.

00:24:19.797 --> 00:24:21.882
Of course you get first dibs,

00:24:21.882 --> 00:24:24.802
Because you're a very customer of mine.

00:24:25.261 --> 00:24:26.345
Thank you, Adel.

00:24:28.431 --> 00:24:29.140
Uh...wait,

00:24:29.140 --> 00:24:30.641
Let me find something that would look good on you.

00:24:32.393 --> 00:24:34.228
That one! That would look really good on you.

00:24:35.479 --> 00:24:36.564
This could work for Belle.

00:24:39.275 --> 00:24:40.026
It's amazing, isn't it?

00:24:40.651 --> 00:24:43.070
They're just clothes, but somehow...

00:24:43.279 --> 00:24:45.781
Each one has its own personality.

00:24:47.825 --> 00:24:49.410
At least with clothes,

00:24:49.869 --> 00:24:51.787
You can tell right away which personality they suit,

00:24:51.857 --> 00:24:53.192
Who they belong to.

00:24:54.415 --> 00:24:55.666
But this body...

00:24:57.043 --> 00:24:58.052
It's a mess.

00:24:59.630 --> 00:25:01.382
So hopefully, when Belle comes back...

00:25:03.436 --> 00:25:05.188
She'll finally be able to accept all of us.

00:25:08.345 --> 00:25:09.597
Don't worry, Ate.

00:25:10.097 --> 00:25:11.640
She'll understand eventually.

00:25:13.642 --> 00:25:14.393
Hopefully.

00:25:15.603 --> 00:25:16.687
What about Estong?

00:25:18.606 --> 00:25:20.941
Will he understand once he knows

00:25:20.941 --> 00:25:23.110
The real reason I've been avoiding him?

00:25:26.322 --> 00:25:27.239
Go on, pick some more.

00:25:27.531 --> 00:25:28.783
Maybe there's something else you might like.

00:25:31.327 --> 00:25:32.411
That's cute, too.

00:25:36.248 --> 00:25:37.230
Ysa!

00:25:41.587 --> 00:25:42.880
Do you want me to handle him?

00:25:45.216 --> 00:25:46.008
Estong.

00:25:46.383 --> 00:25:47.128
Ysa.

00:25:54.183 --> 00:25:55.059
How are you?

00:25:57.978 --> 00:25:58.902
I'm okay.

00:25:59.313 --> 00:26:00.397
How about you?

00:26:01.572 --> 00:26:02.406
I'm okay.

00:26:03.317 --> 00:26:04.401
Just keeping myself busy.

00:26:05.736 --> 00:26:06.821
But sometimes...

00:26:07.488 --> 00:26:09.073
I can't help but think of you.

00:26:12.201 --> 00:26:13.119
I missed you.

00:26:28.050 --> 00:26:28.989
Ysa...

00:26:30.553 --> 00:26:32.012
I just wanted to see you.

00:26:32.763 --> 00:26:33.848
Maybe we could talk.

00:26:39.103 --> 00:26:39.920
I know.

00:26:40.688 --> 00:26:42.773
I know there are some things

00:26:43.552 --> 00:26:44.804
You don't want to tell me.

00:26:45.651 --> 00:26:46.986
They might be complicated.

00:26:48.320 --> 00:26:49.321
Whatever it is,

00:26:50.197 --> 00:26:51.282
I'll respect that.

00:26:52.908 --> 00:26:53.993
I won't push you anymore.

00:26:55.619 --> 00:26:56.553
But...

00:26:56.912 --> 00:26:58.497
I just hope you won't keep on avoiding me.

00:27:01.250 --> 00:27:02.232
Estong.

00:27:04.044 --> 00:27:04.998
I'm sorry.

00:27:06.630 --> 00:27:08.381
I just don't want things to get messy.

00:27:10.676 --> 00:27:11.594
How would things get messy?

00:27:12.678 --> 00:27:13.554
My feelings.

00:27:15.222 --> 00:27:16.599
Does that mean...

00:27:16.807 --> 00:27:17.558
Um...

00:27:18.309 --> 00:27:19.977
Estong, there are still some of my personalities

00:27:19.977 --> 00:27:21.041
You haven't met yet.

00:27:22.771 --> 00:27:24.023
And I don't know...

00:27:24.607 --> 00:27:25.858
What will happen when

00:27:26.025 --> 00:27:27.818
She comes out and you meet her.

00:27:28.986 --> 00:27:29.893
So...

00:27:32.531 --> 00:27:33.282
Let's just leave it at that.

00:27:33.282 --> 00:27:34.366
All I know is...

00:27:36.127 --> 00:27:38.329
I know it's better for all of us

00:27:38.329 --> 00:27:40.748
If my feelings don't get complicated.

00:27:40.748 --> 00:27:42.708
That's why I don't want to complicate things.

00:27:43.883 --> 00:27:45.760
That's why we should just stay friends.

00:27:47.504 --> 00:27:49.840
You can't court me. You can't...

00:27:50.633 --> 00:27:51.717
Just friends, really.

00:27:53.302 --> 00:27:54.553
I hope you understand.

00:27:57.765 --> 00:27:59.433
If... if that's all we can be...

00:27:59.433 --> 00:28:00.267
Okay.

00:28:01.101 --> 00:28:02.102
We'll just be friends.

00:28:03.103 --> 00:28:04.138
That way,

00:28:04.355 --> 00:28:05.648
You won't have to avoid me anymore.

00:28:06.523 --> 00:28:07.441
It's alright for me.

00:28:08.651 --> 00:28:09.485
Estong...

00:28:09.818 --> 00:28:10.736
Ysa, don't worry.

00:28:11.528 --> 00:28:12.404
I understand.

00:28:14.031 --> 00:28:16.283
Thank you for understanding, Estong.

00:28:18.369 --> 00:28:19.270
So,

00:28:19.295 --> 00:28:20.537
We're good now, right?

00:28:21.747 --> 00:28:23.576
You don't have to avoid me anymore or even...

00:28:24.177 --> 00:28:25.459
Hide somewhere

00:28:25.459 --> 00:28:26.961
Where I can see you anyway.

00:28:27.711 --> 00:28:28.646
Alright.

00:28:32.758 --> 00:28:33.842
So,

00:28:34.176 --> 00:28:36.637
Can you paint at Love U Café again?

00:28:39.139 --> 00:28:40.724
Depends. If there's free coffee.

00:28:42.226 --> 00:28:44.061
So all it takes is free coffee. Fine, then.

00:28:45.312 --> 00:28:46.209
I'll take care of it.

00:29:00.953 --> 00:29:02.329
Uh...

00:29:02.443 --> 00:29:04.654
Spanish Latte for Ms. Ysa.

00:29:07.529 --> 00:29:10.568
Cold with 75% sugar.

00:29:14.341 --> 00:29:15.050
Estong,

00:29:15.050 --> 00:29:15.841
Thank you.

00:29:26.312 --> 00:29:27.126
Sorry.

00:29:34.987 --> 00:29:35.754
It's good.

00:29:35.779 --> 00:29:37.031
Just the right balance.

00:29:37.448 --> 00:29:38.415
Thank you.

00:29:38.866 --> 00:29:39.767
You're welcome.

00:29:40.659 --> 00:29:42.369
So, what are you going to paint today?

00:29:43.207 --> 00:29:43.892
Ah.

00:29:43.917 --> 00:29:45.501
I might just sketch for now.

00:29:46.582 --> 00:29:47.666
I see.

00:29:49.084 --> 00:29:50.794
Okay, if you need anything,

00:29:50.794 --> 00:29:51.670
Just let me know...

00:29:51.670 --> 00:29:54.089
Just call my name and I'll be there.

00:29:54.423 --> 00:29:55.841
- Thank you. - Estong!

00:29:57.051 --> 00:29:58.886
Looks like you two are okay now.

00:29:59.720 --> 00:30:02.431
Maybe just as friends, Pops.

00:30:02.639 --> 00:30:04.641
Well, it's better to be friends

00:30:04.641 --> 00:30:06.560
Than enemies, right, son?

00:30:06.810 --> 00:30:07.679
Right.

00:30:07.936 --> 00:30:08.812
Well...

00:30:09.855 --> 00:30:10.939
It's world peace for the both of you.

00:30:18.322 --> 00:30:19.327
There's a customer.

00:30:20.115 --> 00:30:20.897
Hello!

00:30:35.589 --> 00:30:36.632
Lorenz?

00:30:38.258 --> 00:30:39.147
Lorenz.

00:30:42.513 --> 00:30:43.889
What are you looking at?!

00:30:43.889 --> 00:30:45.265
What?!

00:30:45.265 --> 00:30:46.642
Lorenz.

00:31:09.748 --> 00:31:11.041
- Kuya, Kuya, it's Ate! - Dear?

00:31:11.041 --> 00:31:12.046
Are you okay?

00:31:12.418 --> 00:31:13.168
Estong!

00:31:13.168 --> 00:31:13.960
Ysa!

00:31:15.212 --> 00:31:16.130
Ysa, what happened?

00:31:17.131 --> 00:31:18.108
Are you okay?

00:31:19.425 --> 00:31:21.009
Uh...please excuse us.

00:31:21.009 --> 00:31:22.553
She's okay, she's fine.

00:31:22.761 --> 00:31:23.577
Sorry about that.

00:31:31.353 --> 00:31:32.265
Ysa?

00:31:36.358 --> 00:31:37.163
Ysa.

00:31:38.402 --> 00:31:39.351
Are you okay?

00:31:42.739 --> 00:31:43.491
Easy.

00:31:45.033 --> 00:31:45.951
Where am I?

00:31:47.536 --> 00:31:48.454
You're in my room.

00:31:52.124 --> 00:31:54.251
Uh... no, no. You're thinking about it wrong.

00:31:54.251 --> 00:31:56.336
Uh... I had to take you upstairs because

00:31:56.628 --> 00:31:58.230
There were so many people downstairs.

00:31:58.255 --> 00:31:59.590
Many people were staring at us and

00:31:59.590 --> 00:32:00.674
That's after you passed out.

00:32:00.674 --> 00:32:02.384
The door and windows here are open too.

00:32:02.384 --> 00:32:04.386
So if anyone walked by, they would've seen the two of us.

00:32:04.604 --> 00:32:06.319
- I promise, I didn't do anything wrong. - Estong!

00:32:08.056 --> 00:32:09.141
I know.

00:32:11.018 --> 00:32:11.894
I know you.

00:32:15.189 --> 00:32:16.085
You okay now?

00:32:20.068 --> 00:32:21.862
Mhm. I'm okay. I just...

00:32:23.822 --> 00:32:24.740
I just felt dizzy.

00:32:40.214 --> 00:32:42.174
Didn't know you liked books.

00:32:43.258 --> 00:32:44.343
A little bit.

00:32:44.343 --> 00:32:45.969
Those are mostly reviewers.

00:32:48.555 --> 00:32:49.423
For what?

00:32:51.708 --> 00:32:54.211
I want to try taking the licensure exam again.

00:32:55.521 --> 00:32:57.064
Actually, it's going to be my fourth attempt.

00:32:59.316 --> 00:33:00.567
You'll pass this time.

00:33:02.611 --> 00:33:03.525
I hope so.

00:33:06.281 --> 00:33:07.257
Do you...

00:33:07.282 --> 00:33:08.534
Have someone to study with?

00:33:09.743 --> 00:33:10.552
No,

00:33:10.577 --> 00:33:11.408
It's just me.

00:33:13.163 --> 00:33:14.081
Do you...

00:33:14.540 --> 00:33:15.611
Want me to help you?

00:33:18.293 --> 00:33:19.150
Really?

00:33:20.587 --> 00:33:22.005
I can quiz you

00:33:22.005 --> 00:33:22.881
Or even...

00:33:22.881 --> 00:33:25.092
Tell me what you've learned,

00:33:25.092 --> 00:33:27.511
What you've studied, so you'll remember it better.

00:33:28.709 --> 00:33:30.460
I can't pay you for your time, okay?

00:33:31.557 --> 00:33:33.892
You helped us with the exhibit, right?

00:33:34.284 --> 00:33:37.621
- Wow! - So pretty!

00:33:37.793 --> 00:33:39.545
Impressionist. That's me.

00:33:39.856 --> 00:33:41.358
This is your soul.

00:33:42.442 --> 00:33:44.695
- Didn't I tell you to pose properly?! - Okay, okay, wait.

00:33:44.695 --> 00:33:47.447
- So pretty! Clock it! - Yes!

00:33:47.990 --> 00:33:48.907
This time...

00:33:49.741 --> 00:33:51.451
I want to be the one to help you.

00:33:53.620 --> 00:33:54.913
Alright, but no taking it back, okay?

00:33:55.956 --> 00:33:56.873
Until you pass.

00:33:57.521 --> 00:33:58.579
Until I pass.

00:34:07.759 --> 00:34:08.468
Okay.

00:34:19.563 --> 00:34:20.647
Let's study.

00:34:27.571 --> 00:34:28.905
Do you like Estong?

00:34:29.239 --> 00:34:30.699
Let it go.

00:34:31.325 --> 00:34:33.994
We all knew he wouldn't be able to help it, okay?

00:34:46.256 --> 00:34:47.341
What's debt?

00:34:48.800 --> 00:34:49.885
Uh...first word...

00:34:50.218 --> 00:34:50.969
Debit?

00:34:51.345 --> 00:34:52.763
Debit increases...

00:34:53.430 --> 00:34:54.348
E—?

00:34:54.348 --> 00:34:55.474
Enterprise?

00:34:57.142 --> 00:34:59.144
Ex—?

00:34:59.811 --> 00:35:01.355
Ex— expenses.

00:35:01.772 --> 00:35:03.398
Debit increases...

00:35:03.649 --> 00:35:04.816
Assets, dividends.

00:35:05.567 --> 00:35:06.318
Perfect!

00:35:06.777 --> 00:35:07.736
What's FIFO?

00:35:07.819 --> 00:35:09.279
First-In, First-Out.

00:35:09.279 --> 00:35:10.197
What's LIFO?

00:35:10.197 --> 00:35:11.365
Last-In, First-Out.

00:35:11.365 --> 00:35:12.449
What is COIL?

00:35:12.950 --> 00:35:14.117
Charity of...

00:35:14.326 --> 00:35:16.370
Oh, that's way off. Really, really off.

00:35:16.370 --> 00:35:17.162
No connection at all.

00:35:17.329 --> 00:35:18.163
I give up.

00:35:19.831 --> 00:35:20.999
Go on, review it.

00:35:21.541 --> 00:35:22.709
And then I'll film you.

00:35:22.709 --> 00:35:24.878
- If you need it, just play it back. - Alright.

00:35:24.878 --> 00:35:25.545
Okay?

00:35:25.796 --> 00:35:28.173
Weighted Average Cost...

00:35:37.265 --> 00:35:38.183
Thank you.

00:35:52.531 --> 00:35:53.365
When you wake up,

00:35:53.365 --> 00:35:56.118
I'll show you just how loud you snore.

00:36:03.583 --> 00:36:04.960
Thank you, Estong.

00:36:05.711 --> 00:36:06.586
This guy,

00:36:06.586 --> 00:36:08.296
The one who snores so loudly.

00:36:09.297 --> 00:36:11.425
This is the person who helped us.

00:36:16.263 --> 00:36:16.972
Kuya.

00:36:17.180 --> 00:36:18.682
Oh, just set it down right here.

00:36:21.727 --> 00:36:22.561
Thank you.

00:36:22.894 --> 00:36:24.146
It's on the house, okay?

00:36:24.479 --> 00:36:26.940
- Okay, Kuya. - I'm paying for our bill, okay?

00:36:50.881 --> 00:36:52.716
Okay, let's start. What...

00:36:53.675 --> 00:36:55.677
Do you mean by obligation to do

00:36:55.677 --> 00:36:57.429
And obligation to deliver?

00:36:59.347 --> 00:37:00.932
An obligation to deliver

00:37:01.433 --> 00:37:03.477
Is when you are required

00:37:03.643 --> 00:37:05.270
To give something.

00:37:05.604 --> 00:37:07.731
Like an item or money.

00:37:08.106 --> 00:37:09.900
While obligation to do is

00:37:10.066 --> 00:37:11.526
When you're required

00:37:11.777 --> 00:37:13.195
To render a service.

00:37:16.072 --> 00:37:19.034
So I guess your obligation to deliver

00:37:19.034 --> 00:37:21.912
Was to buy me coffee, since I'm helping you with your review.

00:37:23.371 --> 00:37:23.955
Yes.

00:37:24.581 --> 00:37:25.248
And...

00:37:25.874 --> 00:37:28.168
I feel like I have an obligation to...

00:37:29.419 --> 00:37:32.172
Stay by your side so you don't fall asleep

00:37:32.464 --> 00:37:33.882
While we study.

00:37:39.179 --> 00:37:40.263
You're so corny.

00:37:40.555 --> 00:37:41.640
- Go away! - Why?

00:37:41.640 --> 00:37:42.724
That was a good one.

00:37:42.933 --> 00:37:44.017
Keep your distance!

00:37:45.393 --> 00:37:46.311
This is okay.

00:37:46.603 --> 00:37:47.687
- Move some more. - Huh?

00:37:47.687 --> 00:37:48.438
Move a little bit more.

00:37:48.939 --> 00:37:50.023
Okay, game. What's next?

00:37:50.023 --> 00:37:51.049
Okay, next.

00:37:51.650 --> 00:37:53.944
What are the acquistion methods?

00:37:54.653 --> 00:37:56.571
- The acquisition methods... - Okay?

00:37:56.947 --> 00:37:58.031
Of business...

00:37:58.532 --> 00:37:59.282
Wait, okay?

00:38:00.534 --> 00:38:01.993
The acquisition method...

00:38:13.755 --> 00:38:15.340
I'm sorry, Estong.

00:38:18.009 --> 00:38:19.469
I see it...

00:38:20.554 --> 00:38:23.390
I can feel the effort you're making.

00:38:28.311 --> 00:38:30.397
But I'm not the right personality

00:38:30.397 --> 00:38:32.357
To make decisions for all of us.

00:39:22.866 --> 00:39:23.491
Alright.

00:39:23.909 --> 00:39:25.911
Thank you so much for your time and I'll message you

00:39:26.077 --> 00:39:28.622
For the revised materials and updates

00:39:28.622 --> 00:39:29.539
At the end of the day.

00:39:30.332 --> 00:39:32.292
Sound good, mate. Looking forward to it.

00:39:33.251 --> 00:39:33.793
Okay.

00:39:34.085 --> 00:39:34.669
Take care.

00:39:56.858 --> 00:39:57.751
Hey.

00:39:57.776 --> 00:39:58.693
You're already here.

00:39:59.945 --> 00:40:01.196
Hey. What are you up to?

00:40:01.780 --> 00:40:03.990
Uhh...I'm just filling out a form.

00:40:04.616 --> 00:40:05.867
What form? What is it?

00:40:06.660 --> 00:40:08.745
Secret! I don't want to jinx it.

00:40:08.745 --> 00:40:09.871
It might not happen.

00:40:12.165 --> 00:40:15.168
Oh, so you're keeping secrets now, huh?

00:40:15.377 --> 00:40:16.795
You also have your own secrets, right?

00:40:17.087 --> 00:40:17.837
So we're even.

00:40:18.880 --> 00:40:19.673
Right.

00:40:20.674 --> 00:40:21.216
Oh!

00:40:22.300 --> 00:40:23.760
Get ready. Time for our review.

00:40:27.347 --> 00:40:28.473
Let's take a break first.

00:40:29.683 --> 00:40:30.266
Huh?

00:40:30.642 --> 00:40:31.184
Why?

00:40:35.272 --> 00:40:36.064
Because

00:40:36.064 --> 00:40:38.650
You promised you'd teach me how to paint, remember?

00:40:40.860 --> 00:40:41.361
Me?

00:40:41.653 --> 00:40:42.237
Yes.

00:40:42.946 --> 00:40:43.488
Oh?

00:40:44.280 --> 00:40:45.532
I don't think I remember that.

00:40:46.783 --> 00:40:47.867
Hey, I remember that very clearly.

00:40:47.867 --> 00:40:49.661
You said you'd teach me how to paint.

00:40:50.120 --> 00:40:50.704
Maybe...

00:40:50.704 --> 00:40:52.205
Maybe that was another personality?

00:40:53.248 --> 00:40:54.119
Oh, really?

00:40:55.667 --> 00:40:56.479
Just kidding.

00:40:57.293 --> 00:40:58.378
I remember it.

00:41:00.714 --> 00:41:01.464
So,

00:41:01.631 --> 00:41:02.757
Are you going to teach me how to paint now?

00:41:04.801 --> 00:41:05.802
Let's do it now? Come on.

00:41:22.318 --> 00:41:23.028
Oh!

00:41:25.447 --> 00:41:26.239
I made a mistake.

00:41:26.906 --> 00:41:29.200
I pushed the brush too hard.

00:41:30.076 --> 00:41:30.785
Oh.

00:41:30.785 --> 00:41:31.619
It looks bad now.

00:41:32.162 --> 00:41:33.079
No, it won't be.

00:41:34.289 --> 00:41:35.915
Just because you made a mistake

00:41:35.915 --> 00:41:37.542
Doesn't mean the painting is ruined.

00:41:39.794 --> 00:41:41.046
Isn't that how it works?

00:41:42.172 --> 00:41:43.089
It depends.

00:41:43.673 --> 00:41:46.301
Besides, we're using acrylic.

00:41:46.760 --> 00:41:49.387
It dries quickly, so if you make a mistake,

00:41:49.387 --> 00:41:52.223
Just let it set, then paint over it.

00:41:52.891 --> 00:41:53.975
And sometimes...

00:41:54.392 --> 00:41:56.311
The problem is not the color,

00:41:56.311 --> 00:41:57.228
It's the value.

00:41:58.813 --> 00:41:59.564
Value?

00:41:59.898 --> 00:42:00.482
Yes.

00:42:00.982 --> 00:42:01.733
The value.

00:42:02.525 --> 00:42:04.944
How light or dark it is.

00:42:05.111 --> 00:42:07.530
Sometimes, you can get the color right,

00:42:07.864 --> 00:42:10.742
But if the value is off, it can still look wrong.

00:42:12.285 --> 00:42:13.703
This is also pretty complicated, huh?

00:42:14.454 --> 00:42:15.538
Not really.

00:42:15.997 --> 00:42:17.082
Just needs a lot of practice.

00:42:18.416 --> 00:42:19.000
And sometimes...

00:42:19.375 --> 00:42:22.253
Even the things you think you did wrong,

00:42:23.463 --> 00:42:25.757
Can end up making the painting even better.

00:42:30.178 --> 00:42:31.930
You can add some more...

00:42:33.598 --> 00:42:35.266
You can also lessen it.

00:42:38.061 --> 00:42:40.605
All of those things can contribute to the composition.

00:42:45.902 --> 00:42:46.820
Uh...

00:42:47.529 --> 00:42:49.405
I thought that whenever you make a mistake...

00:42:50.031 --> 00:42:51.449
You have to erase it.

00:42:53.201 --> 00:42:55.161
Just because you made a mistake...

00:42:56.788 --> 00:42:58.415
Doesn't mean you have to erase it.

00:43:10.760 --> 00:43:11.673
Right.

00:43:13.930 --> 00:43:14.639
Wait a minute.

00:43:14.639 --> 00:43:16.683
Can you try this stroke here?

00:43:17.016 --> 00:43:19.144
Go ahead, let me see how you do it.

00:43:19.394 --> 00:43:20.384
Let's see.

00:43:20.979 --> 00:43:22.480
- Just like that. - Oh, that's how you do it.

00:43:22.818 --> 00:43:24.048
Like this?

00:43:25.191 --> 00:43:26.943
Why do you have paint on your nose?

00:43:26.943 --> 00:43:27.986
I didn't notice that before.

00:43:27.986 --> 00:43:29.322
Did you just put that there?

00:43:31.823 --> 00:43:34.159
Hey, you think you're with Yeye or something?

00:43:34.159 --> 00:43:36.665
You can't win me over with those antics.

00:43:37.120 --> 00:43:38.538
Right. You're not Yeye.

00:43:40.498 --> 00:43:41.958
So what's the yarn for?

00:43:41.958 --> 00:43:42.834
That one there.

00:43:43.168 --> 00:43:44.970
- Oh! - What's that for?

00:43:46.129 --> 00:43:47.063
This?

00:43:47.088 --> 00:43:49.215
You can use this for texture.

00:43:49.924 --> 00:43:51.384
So you just dip it in the paint,

00:43:52.385 --> 00:43:53.136
Then...

00:43:54.262 --> 00:43:55.138
You can do it like this.

00:43:57.390 --> 00:43:58.329
So like...

00:43:58.558 --> 00:44:01.853
I saw somewhere that they make it thicker, like this.

00:44:02.520 --> 00:44:03.376
Yeah.

00:44:03.479 --> 00:44:06.274
Then, they also use it for this!

00:44:07.400 --> 00:44:08.860
- You cheeky... - Like this, right?

00:44:10.028 --> 00:44:11.087
Like this.

00:44:14.866 --> 00:44:15.366
Uh...

00:44:15.950 --> 00:44:16.843
Uh...

00:44:16.868 --> 00:44:18.786
We just brought you something to eat.

00:44:19.746 --> 00:44:21.497
Thank you!

00:44:25.210 --> 00:44:26.118
Come on.

00:44:35.720 --> 00:44:36.804
I thought

00:44:36.804 --> 00:44:38.973
They were just doing a painting tutorial.

00:44:38.973 --> 00:44:40.558
So why does it look like they're flirting?

00:44:41.392 --> 00:44:42.143
Let them be.

00:44:42.852 --> 00:44:43.937
They look like they're having fun.

00:44:45.313 --> 00:44:46.397
What do you mean, "let them be"?

00:44:46.397 --> 00:44:48.149
Didn't we have an agreement with Ysa?

00:44:50.318 --> 00:44:52.695
Love, they're just friends, right?

00:44:52.695 --> 00:44:53.986
Oh, yeah. Not obvious at all.

00:44:55.657 --> 00:44:57.116
Weren't we like that before, too?

00:44:57.617 --> 00:44:58.368
Come on.

00:44:58.368 --> 00:44:59.369
That's the thing, okay?

00:44:59.369 --> 00:45:00.912
Look at us right now.

00:45:01.287 --> 00:45:02.705
Well, we ended up getting married.

00:45:06.376 --> 00:45:08.544
You know, love...

00:45:08.962 --> 00:45:11.464
Maybe we should just talk to them later, okay?

00:45:11.798 --> 00:45:12.899
We should.

00:45:12.924 --> 00:45:13.900
Relax.

00:45:26.187 --> 00:45:27.220
Uh...Ysa.

00:45:27.647 --> 00:45:28.532
Yes?

00:45:29.315 --> 00:45:30.208
I just want to say thank you.

00:45:30.233 --> 00:45:31.484
I learned a lot from you.

00:45:32.735 --> 00:45:33.650
Me too.

00:45:34.570 --> 00:45:36.447
I also learned a lot from you, Estong.

00:45:40.118 --> 00:45:41.353
Let me help you.

00:46:08.730 --> 00:46:09.641
Ysa.

00:46:13.151 --> 00:46:14.266
I really love you.

00:46:42.013 --> 00:46:44.015
You don't seem hard to love.

00:46:44.015 --> 00:46:46.017
Yeye wants cake.

00:46:46.351 --> 00:46:46.976
There's a crazy person here.

00:46:46.976 --> 00:46:48.353
I'm scared of you.

00:46:48.728 --> 00:46:49.896
You're crazy!

00:46:50.647 --> 00:46:51.397
No.

00:47:05.745 --> 00:47:06.621
Ysa?

00:47:07.163 --> 00:47:08.581
I'm not Ysa!

00:47:08.581 --> 00:47:09.665
My name is Belle!

00:47:17.382 --> 00:47:18.321
Belle.

00:47:19.300 --> 00:47:20.188
Ysa!

00:47:20.676 --> 00:47:21.761
Estong, don't.

00:47:22.470 --> 00:47:23.907
There's something you need to know.

00:47:25.932 --> 00:47:26.849
Ysa...

00:47:26.849 --> 00:47:28.684
Is just one of the personalities.

00:47:31.437 --> 00:47:32.548
It's Belle.

00:47:32.573 --> 00:47:34.241
She's the real Ysabelle.

00:47:37.276 --> 00:47:38.180
What?

00:47:47.354 --> 00:47:48.328
Belle is...

00:47:48.621 --> 00:47:51.958
The first of them all. She’s the original.

00:47:52.291 --> 00:47:54.794
I still want to get to know Belle.

00:47:55.169 --> 00:47:57.463
But they're not the same person, okay?

00:47:58.297 --> 00:48:00.591
They have different personalities.

00:48:01.175 --> 00:48:03.511
Their Nanang even said that...

00:48:04.053 --> 00:48:05.555
Belle isn't okay yet.

00:48:05.888 --> 00:48:08.391
What? Do you want Ysa to get confused again?

00:48:08.558 --> 00:48:10.184
But I want to see you again.

00:48:10.643 --> 00:48:12.687
You promised you'd come to my exhibit again.

00:48:14.105 --> 00:48:15.231
Ysa.

00:48:15.231 --> 00:48:16.149
I mean...Belle.

00:48:16.774 --> 00:48:17.641
You?

00:48:19.485 --> 00:48:20.501
You know me?

00:48:20.736 --> 00:48:23.281
Just because you're friends with my personalities,

00:48:23.281 --> 00:48:24.657
Doesn't mean we're friends too.

00:48:24.657 --> 00:48:26.784
You know, I really thought you wouldn't talk to me anymore.

00:48:27.076 --> 00:48:29.495
Because you're Belle now. You're so different from—

00:48:29.495 --> 00:48:31.289
I'm so different because of my condition?

00:48:34.500 --> 00:48:36.508
Wow! Look at you!

00:48:36.753 --> 00:48:38.546
All dressed up! The outfit...

00:48:38.546 --> 00:48:41.299
The shoes, the hair.

00:48:42.341 --> 00:48:43.593
Looks nice, right?

00:48:43.593 --> 00:48:45.178
Belle?

